Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.03,0:00:00.96,Short,,0,0,0,,Your dog tilts
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.96,0:00:01.38,Short,,0,0,0,,its head
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.38,0:00:02.42,Short,,0,0,0,,and it's not just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.42,0:00:03.34,Short,,0,0,0,,to look cute
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:04.72,Short,,0,0,0,,In one study
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.72,0:00:05.42,Short,,0,0,0,,dogs that knew
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.42,0:00:05.88,Short,,0,0,0,,the names
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:07.06,Short,,0,0,0,,of lots of toys
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:08.12,Short,,0,0,0,,tilted their heads
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.12,0:00:08.96,Short,,0,0,0,,almost half
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.96,0:00:09.56,Short,,0,0,0,,the time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.56,0:00:10.14,Short,,0,0,0,,when their owner
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.14,0:00:11.46,Short,,0,0,0,,said a toy's name
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:12.74,Short,,0,0,0,,Ordinary dogs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.74,0:00:13.54,Short,,0,0,0,,barely did it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.54,0:00:14.32,Short,,0,0,0,,at all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:14.84,Short,,0,0,0,,So the tilt
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.84,0:00:15.76,Short,,0,0,0,,may be your dog
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.76,0:00:16.66,Short,,0,0,0,,matching the word
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.66,0:00:17.30,Short,,0,0,0,,to the toy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.30,0:00:18.32,Short,,0,0,0,,in its memory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.60,0:00:19.78,Short,,0,0,0,,Another idea
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.78,0:00:20.68,Short,,0,0,0,,a long snout
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.68,0:00:21.36,Short,,0,0,0,,blocks part
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:21.92,Short,,0,0,0,,of your face
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.92,0:00:22.58,Short,,0,0,0,,and tilting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:23.08,Short,,0,0,0,,helps them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.08,0:00:23.99,Short,,0,0,0,,see you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.99,0:00:24.88,Short,,0,0,0,,And in that study
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:25.60,Short,,0,0,0,,each dog had
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:26.58,Short,,0,0,0,,a favorite side
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:27.50,Short,,0,0,0,,like being left-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.50,0:00:28.26,Short,,0,0,0,,or right-handed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:29.52,Short,,0,0,0,,So watch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.52,0:00:30.06,Short,,0,0,0,,which way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.06,0:00:30.76,Short,,0,0,0,,yours goes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.76,0:00:31.54,Short,,0,0,0,,when you ask
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.54,0:00:32.50,Short,,0,0,0,,who wants a walk?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.99,0:00:30.72,Prompt,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,250)}Send this to someone\Nwhose dog does the tilt
